WEBVTT

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.450
Zelada!

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.410
Hello, Lady Exedilica.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.290
It's an honor to see you again.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.450
You!

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.910
And Sir Matoba, you seem to be doing well...

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.080
Zelada!

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.790
How terrifying.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.000
So perhaps... excuse me.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.000
Tilarna!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.330
Zelada, you piece of shit!

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.410
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.580
Well, that's certainly concerning.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.580
Perhaps you should take a nap instead.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.080
You caught a suspect in the gun smuggling case?

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:04.080
Yes. We're just about to get
more information, but...

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.370
Eugene Bolai. A Semanian immigrant.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:09.290
One of those Lahge guys.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:13.160
He was using the company's equipment
to make that steel stuff little by little.

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.830
The history's been deleted, but...

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:19.790
You weren't investors?

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:23.790
Sorry. We're the cops.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:26.910
Got it. Yeah, bring him in.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.830
Sheesh, where the hell are Matoba and Exedilica?

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.200
Lady Exedilica,

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.620
how are you feeling?

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.000
Terrible.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:47.370
Not because of your magic.
But because of your face.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.330
Your voice is so beautiful.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:54.160
Though it sounds a little barbaric
speaking the words of the doreany.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.660
Lately I've taken a liking to their language.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:58.450
It has lots of insults.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:02.040
I'd prefer not to hear
such words coming from you.

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:06.200
Die, Zelada, you disgusting old geezer.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.290
Get on your knees, press that smirking
face of yours against the ground,

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:11.620
and piss yourself while you beg for forgiveness.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.410
How very sad.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:19.080
As I've always said, nothing good comes
of spending too much time on Earth.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:23.290
Where's Kei? Tell me now, so I can
send you to hell where you belong!

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.660
Oh, Sir Matoba?

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.700
Well, I hope he's all right.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:36.120
But that FBI agent doesn't seem
the type to ask questions delicately.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.540
That man named Chan?

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:40.660
What are you planning with him?

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.040
The same thing I was planning with Sir Roth.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.540
Our interests are aligned, you see.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.870
I don't have any ideals.

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:53.790
I just want to live life on easy street.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:57.290
So that's why you teamed up with Zelada?

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.000
He's a lot more cunning than he looks, you know.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:02.160
Taking risks is what business is all about.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:07.450
Our original plan had been for
Coal Mozeleemay to win the election.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:10.250
He's incompetent and easy to control.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.370
If Kahns and Tourte died
to accidents during the election,

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.910
Coal would be the next mayor.

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:20.870
It was important to Zelada
that Semanians use Earth weapons

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:23.450
to carry to the assassinations.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.870
Why?

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:31.250
So that you'll all hate each other.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.580
The Semanians and the doreany.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.540
And the vaifaht steel gun?

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:43.040
Mrs. Mozeleemay wanted Semanian support badly.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:46.040
She would look after any craftsman from
the other world who wanted to come here,

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.620
even giving them work.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:51.830
Craftsmen? The Lahge...

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.790
The complexity of this device astounded me.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.250
Who'd believe it could be a gun?

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.120
It's truly magic.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.750
Laugh.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.700
One, two, three.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:17.450
I guess you can't fire it unless it's a gun.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.950
That's what killed Coal.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:22.540
It was Ethan who decided
that without talking to us.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:23.700
Ethan?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:27.120
The assassin you slew.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:33.750
He was a marine who went missing
eight years ago in the Semani world.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:38.120
And somehow he came back,
with knowledge of magic and swordsmanship.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.790
Ethan Dole.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:43.660
A man with potential... for a doreany.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:47.120
Was it you who trained him?

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.450
Of course not.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:51.290
I'm terrible with a sword.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.660
You've figured it out, haven't you?

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:57.000
You should have recognized that style.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.540
Oh, Leeze...

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.160
Leeze.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:09.620
In the Mirvor, that word means "Master."

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.040
Which means... which means...?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.700
Lady Exedilica.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:18.290
It's time to tell you how I feel.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:24.500
I fear for the future of our world,
for Leto Semani.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.910
So you turned to terrorism?

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:28.290
I'll say it as many times as I have to.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:32.040
The Semanians and the doreany
must hate each other.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:38.080
Otherwise, it will be impossible
to protect our lands from their civilization.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.290
Civilization?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:43.540
You must know the tragedy
that's taking place in your homeland.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:49.660
Earth... Doreany weapons, doreany tools,
disgusting "pornography"... everywhere.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.290
Even things like this...

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.750
Disgusting noise like this...

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:02.910
The Semanian people are gladly accepting it all.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:05.330
Sir Elbaji was a skilled warrior
and highly intelligent man,

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:10.910
but he spent too much time among
the wickedness of the doreany.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:15.700
Men such as him will soon
be found everywhere in our world.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.950
"Decadence."

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:22.700
That is the only word to
describe doreany civilization.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:26.870
I have done evil. I have killed innocents.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:30.500
But I have never given in to decadence.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.830
I swear to you, not even once.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:38.450
Now, let's get to the point, Detective Matoba.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.950
I want to talk business with you.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.250
What can I do for you?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.080
I want the photo.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.200
The scandal photo that Randall took.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:51.160
I want to be the only one who has it.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.910
I can't have anyone else having it.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.160
You want my password.

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:01.160
You want to delete that stupid
picture from my account?

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.950
Hacking the account of a city
police officer isn't an easy thing to do.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:10.870
Right now, Marla is taking
the lead in the mayoral lead.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:15.160
She has the sympathy votes.
She'll win at this rate.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.620
Marla was your client, right?

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.790
And you're going to blackmail her?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.370
We're very greedy, you see.

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:27.080
We can't have you or Randall
owning a copy of that photo.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.950
I see.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:33.330
You can torture me, but if I can
last the four days until the election,

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:35.790
you'll have a problem.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:39.000
I'm glad you follow.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.620
Looks like that Marla woman is one nasty bitch.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.250
I couldn't say.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:51.620
I don't care who the next mayor is,
as long as they and I can be friends.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:56.750
Now, tell me the password, and I'll free you.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:00.250
Of course, I'll pay you for your trouble too.
Fifty thousand dollars.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.370
You need to be a part of this too.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:06.370
Fine.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.120
The pass is seven characters.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:15.500
Don't get it wrong.
The first letter is F. Then U.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:20.450
Then C. Then K.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.200
Are you fucking with me?

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:28.080
I'm totally serious. That's the problem.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:32.080
It appears we're at an impasse
in negotiations then, Detective Matoba.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:35.620
This never was a negotiation!

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:39.950
You'll free me if I tell you
the password? And pay me?

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.910
Who the hell would be
dumb enough to believe that?

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.410
Tell me.

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:51.160
I told you. It's F-U--

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.660
Oww...

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.660
Tell me! Now get up!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:02.080
Don't mess with me!

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.330
Wake up--

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:06.910
Stop!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:26.330
A guy's head isn't like a soccer ball... oww.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.910
Randall... I'm sorry.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.580
Decadence.

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:21.250
The only thing that can preserve our home

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:25.040
from this devouring decadence is hatred.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.330
Hatred to the point where you don't
even want to look upon a doreany tool.

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:33.000
That is the only way to survive, I believe.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:38.200
Lady Exedilica, don't tell me you
intend to accept this decadence?

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.750
Down that path lies depravity.

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.330
Depravity. Depravity, you said?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:48.290
Indeed. The introduction of doreany culture--

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:53.000
Zelada, what you call "depravity"
is just fear of change!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.000
Nonsense!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.160
It's true. You're a coward.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.160
All your talk about the evil you've done

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:03.160
just hides the fact that you're afraid
of the chaos of the world.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.790
I do not fear it.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:08.870
Someday I'll find something
that shines within the filth.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.410
Impossible.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.620
Look at reality.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.200
What you say is--

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.080
Reality, you said.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:21.120
Then let me tell you this: the gate is open!

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.410
And it won't be closing.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.830
We have to change.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.250
We have no choice but to do
the best we can under that situation!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.910
I see.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:35.040
I'm disappointed, Lady Exedilica.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.700
Kill me then, if you must.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:43.000
But remember this well:
you couldn't change the mind of a single girl.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.450
And if you can't do that,

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:48.040
it's impossible for you to achieve
the great things you hope for.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.790
Very well then.

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:52.200
Farewell, Lady Exedilica.

00:11:55.870 --> 00:12:02.120
It seems you are protected
by the grace of Kizenya.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.200
It's Sir Matoba.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:07.370
He's tearing a path through my puppets...

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:10.700
Kei!

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:20.450
Zelada!

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:32.830
Zelada, looks like you're a shitty dancer.

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:39.910
Disaster!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:43.620
My servants are being
defeated one after another.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:49.410
Of course. The dead you control
cannot possibly stop Kei Matoba!

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.790
So it seems.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.250
So, what to do then?

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:01.750
Kei will be here soon.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:04.040
Give up and surrender.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:12.000
It seems my last servant has fallen.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:20.500
I was afraid because I wasn't sure
whether to have you or Sir Matoba die first.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.370
What?

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:27.700
What would Sir Matoba say when
he gets here and finds your corpse?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:34.540
Or what would you say if Sir Matoba
were to perish in front of you?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.000
It was a difficult choice to make.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.200
You scum.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.250
I've made my choice.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.910
I wish to see Sir Matoba's despair.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.660
And so...

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.830
Lady Exedilica...

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.450
Arms of steel. Protection of the war god!

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:01.500
Scales of lead. Transmutation of hell.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.330
You need to learn to give up.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:12.160
This isn't like you at all.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.580
You're certainly hanging in there.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.700
So perhaps...

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.620
Zelada!

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:50.620
You're here early, Sir Matoba.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:53.830
I'm in dire peril!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:55.080
And so...

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.410
Kei, above you!

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:13.540
Kei!

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.040
We'll use the sprinklers.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.540
When we see him, attack at the same time I do.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:23.410
I'm sorry... I can't stand up.
My strength hasn't returned.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:25.910
Fine.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:26.950
So...

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:34.540
How can you assail my poor
old ears with such noise?

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:38.080
I thought my eardrums would burst.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:43.160
I shall send you to hell with
all the suffering I can muster!

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.410
You still haven't learned.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.410
There!

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:57.080
Very clever. However...

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:59.870
You can't aim at me from here!

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.830
Kizenya, forgive me.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:17.700
Unbelievable... unbelievable...

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.370
It can't be...

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:41.330
Yuck.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.200
I'm gonna have nightmares of that.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:48.450
Rick, I pulled it off.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.200
Can you move?

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.450
A little.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.120
Have this back.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.410
I'm sorry.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.540
Don't worry about it.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:13.790
No, I was talking to the sword.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.370
Oh, I see.

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:31.080
They won't be able to send backup for a while.

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.250
Why?

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.910
All these riots and stuff.

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.330
All the cars are out on calls.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.790
They said to wait 30 minutes.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.500
This city's done for.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.080
I see.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.370
What about Randall?

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:50.250
I couldn't save him.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.500
I see.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.120
Speaking of Randall...

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.790
What do we do with this photo?

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.620
Why are you asking me?

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:02.910
If I give this to HQ,
it'll probably be made public,

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:06.290
and Mrs. Mozeleemay is done for.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.950
Tourte will win in a landslide.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:11.910
So you want to delete it?

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:14.450
It's legally and ethically wrong,

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.910
but I can play dumb.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:19.330
To be honest, I don't care what we do.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:25.160
The gods of Kizenya would not forgive that.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.750
The lightning of judgment...

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:31.790
I'm sorry, it should be my decision,
not the gods', right?

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.040
I think so.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.290
Then that photo...

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:41.000
Turn it in. It's important evidence.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.450
You're sure?

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:44.080
Yeah.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:50.290
And even if the town's a mess now,
no matter who the mayor is,

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:52.000
it's still a good town.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.410
Because...

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:54.870
Because?

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:03.450
Well... because there's lots
of good people here.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.330
Maybe so.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.370
Because...

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.700
...you're here.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:26.870
Peace returned to the city.

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:32.790
All the people who'd been screaming
and yelling just seemed to disappear.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:37.290
Before, I would've looked down
on them as barbarians.

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:39.580
But now things are different.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:43.370
They're afraid, worried, and confused.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.750
Just like us,

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:48.870
they're people.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:54.250
The Knights always taught me
to wipe out evil wherever I found it.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.540
--But...
--And I swear to...

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.330
But now I've started to learn

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:02.080
which evils can be defeated
and which can be forgiven.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.200
Does that make me weaker?

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:09.250
But if it's also made me a little smarter,

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.160
I think it's a small price to pay.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:16.290
Father, please don't be sad.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.500
I'm staying in this town.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:24.330
In this town where so many weak,
foolish, and greedy people live.

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:29.450
But I love them. And I'm going to stay
here and find a path with them.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:34.700
Please send my best wishes
to my mother and Shajinna.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.870
May the light of Kizenya shine upon you...

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:44.750
Let's get going.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:58.120
U-Um...

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.370
What?

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.500
Sergeant Exedilica.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:07.790
I wanted to talk...

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:09.040
Do you have some time?

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:28.910
He apologized for before.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.830
He feels really bad about it, I think.

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:34.330
What would you do?

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:42.410
Have him spin three times in a circle and bark.
And then you'll be even.

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:43.700
Got it.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.120
Wait--

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:49.660
Spin three times in a circle and bark.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:55.500
One, two, three, bark.

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.790
Let's go, Tilarna.

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:12.160
Earthlings aren't so bad, are they?
